          },
          "author": "Yoto Studios",
          "description": "Are you ready for sleep?\n\nNow, let’s dream…\n\nYoto Dreams is a weekly bedtime podcast filled with gentle meditation, calming stories, and relaxing music. \nEvery Sunday brings a new story to make bedtime a little dreamier. Each story is read twice, with the second reading slower, so little ones can drift off as they listen.\n\nBrought to you by the award winning Yoto Studios team at yotoplay.com, every episode is written, read, edited and produced in-house and with care. \n\nAnd a big thank you to the very special Yoto kids who voiced our Yawn Chorus. \n",
